		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "29644410-adcd-4482-8a17-634606bd149c")
		(at 129.160401 61 180)
		(descr "Molex 219116 PCIe CEM5 12V-2x6 right-angle THT header assy, 16ckt (12 power + 4 sideband). Official Molex footprint, MPN 2191161161 (T&R) = 2191160161 (tray), doc 2191160001-SD. Pads remapped to CEC schematic numbering: 1-6 = +12V (row adjacent to signal), 7-12 = GND (outer row), 13-16 = sideband S1..S4 (SENSE0/SENSE1/CARD_PWR_STABLE/CARD_CBL_PRES#). 9.2A/power pin, 12V. VERIFY +12V/GND pin assignment against PCIe CEM5.1 / the target GPU before power.")
